	"data": "The Homelab Is a Brain That Didn't Know It Was One\n\nConnection between: calcifer-memory ↔ homelab-2025-buildout\n\nThe Surface\n\nThese two concepts seem like different layers of the same stack. The homelab hosts the memory systems. Star runs the RAG pipeline. The vault lives on disk. OpenClaw runs as a service. One is infrastructure, the other is cognition. One is plumbing, the other is thinking.\n\nThat framing is wrong. Or rather, it's a framing that hides the most interesting thing about the…",
